message: "If you use this pattern or software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "vegapunk-agents: A Multi-Agent Architecture Pattern (and Conceptual Framework)"
abstract: >-
  vegapunk-agents is a multi-agent architecture pattern in which a human
  orchestrator (Stella) coordinates six cognitively-biased specialist
  satellites that read from and write to a shared memory (Punk Records).
  Work is run in one of three activation modes using 2, 4 or 6 satellites.
  The framework is fully decoupled from the use cases built on top of it.
